/***************************************************
 
 * Module: mips_16_core_top
 * Project: mips_16
 * Author: fzy
 * Description: 
 *     top module of mips_16 cpu core. Technical details:
 *			1.	16-bit data width
 *			2.	classic 5-stage static pipeline, 1 branch delay slot, theoretical CPI is 1.0
